-- Photo batch 2026-11-23-legoland.
-- Swap the LEGOLAND Holidays event page gallery on wfadd_legoland_florida.
-- The event page reads signals.christmas_photo_gallery through readChristmasEventPhotos
-- in lib/christmasPlacePhotos.js (loadEventDetailPhotos in lib/placeDetailGallery.js).
-- Two official photos showed close faces of children (the wreath family cover and
-- the two girls with LEGO Santa). Five more were daytime entrance sign photos, not
-- holiday photos. This batch replaces that nine photo gallery with six official
-- LEGOLAND Florida Resort holiday photos: brick Christmas tree (cover), the tree
-- at night, fireworks, guests watching fireworks from behind, the elf show, and
-- the snowman character. Every file is a 1280x853 JPEG of at most 200KB, credited
-- Photo: LEGOLAND Florida Resort. No close faces of children.
-- Guarded: the update runs only when christmas_photo_gallery still exactly matches
-- the snapshot read on 23 Nov 2026. signals.photos and signals.photo_gallery are
-- not changed. Do not run this file until the photo files are on the site and Gabe
-- has approved the apply.
begin;

update wf_inventory
